#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:2 b52f792a421041dd9749521da6fbd4ec
msgid "The TCP Server APIs"
msgstr "TCP 服务器 API"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:5 207e3afc4b174d23b57784051252cd1a
msgid "TCP Server setup API"
msgstr "TCP 服务器设置 API"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:7 4b55c6a95a914e4b8125d0261e3e9ee1
msgid ""
"The TCP Server Setup API is used to create a TCP server. The server in the "
"protocol is usually used to connect and listen to the TCP clients and handle"
" the data from the clients."
msgstr "TCP 服务器设置 API 用于创建 TCP 服务器。协议中的服务器通常用于连接和监听TCP客户端并处理来自客户端的数据。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:31 bc025698b381404ab2b38255e6c9a378
msgid ""
"The TCP Server Setup API is defined in the ``TCP_Server_Base`` class. The "
"parameters of the ``__init__`` method are as follows:"
msgstr "TCP 服务器设置 API 在“TCP_Server_Base”类中定义。 ``__init__``方法的参数如下："

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:34 3fea17ba735b400ead6845660925c629
msgid "``host``: The host IP address to bind the TCP server to."
msgstr "``host``：绑定 TCP 服务器的主机 IP 地址。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:35 138fba525e3d4cc4b45de13d41dcccc8
msgid "``port``: The port number to bind the TCP server to."
msgstr "``port``：绑定 TCP 服务器的端口号。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:36 5d43377499e340799441608d4b8141ed
msgid ""
"``max_clients``: The maximum number of concurrent clients the server can "
"handle."
msgstr "``max_clients``：服务器可以处理的并发客户端的最大数量。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:37 c38a7e31478d4959b7ca63b19d8a9058
msgid "``port_add_step``: The step size for incrementing the port number."
msgstr "``port_add_step``：增加端口号的步长。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:38 6811a4baaf8d4e8286f8c3e91921a73f
msgid "``port_range_num``: The number of ports to check in the range."
msgstr "``port_range_num``：范围内要检查的端口数。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:39 8faa3404fac041db9edc663744618cfd
msgid ""
"``max_file_transfer_thread_num``: The maximum number of threads for file "
"transfer operations."
msgstr "``max_file_transfer_thread_num``：文件传输操作的最大线程数。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:40 dacdadbcffa2491ca3ef7b17086d1fe7
msgid ""
"``is_hand_alloc_port``: A flag indicating whether to manually allocate the "
"port."
msgstr "``is_hand_alloc_port``：指示是否手动分配端口的标志。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:41 19d4f0e1e91e4e8a88fd29dd6d4029c4
msgid ""
"``is_input_command_in_console``: A flag indicating whether to input commands"
" in the console."
msgstr "``is_input_command_in_console``：指示是否在控制台中输入命令的标志。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:42 94c750b6d452441ea4ccaa1b972b3cd6
msgid "``max_custom_workers``: The maximum number of custom worker threads."
msgstr "``max_custom_workers``：自定义工作线程的最大数量。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:43 95ef4bf6f4614f8e94e3c8ec0b7963be
msgid ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``: A flag indicating whether the messages exchanged "
"with clients are RSA-encrypted (see :ref:`tcp-server-encrypted-channel-"
"api`)."
msgstr ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``：指示与客户端交换的消息是否经过 RSA 加密的标志（请参阅 tcp-server-encrypted-"
"channel-api`）。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:45 2ac69e3501fd4893800b3f74c3421c61
msgid ""
"``is_custom_keys``: An optional ``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` pair of "
"user-supplied RSA keys. Both files must exist, parse as PEM, and pair with "
"each other; an invalid pair is silently ignored and the default key lookup "
"is used instead (``None`` keeps the default lookup)."
msgstr ""
"``is_custom_keys``：可选的``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` 用户提供的 RSA "
"密钥对。两个文件都必须存在，解析为 PEM，并且相互配对；无效的对将被默默地忽略，并使用默认的键查找（``None`` 保留默认查找）。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:50 8658c4f5af2f4960865a233821bf2fb6
msgid "All parameters have default values:"
msgstr "每个参数都有默认值："

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:52 b4b329e993944d9d8122d12b33b73324
msgid "``host``: Default is ``'127.0.0.1'``"
msgstr "“主机”：默认为“127.0.0.1”"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:53 666f7dab5e4a40ac8d3c751524db2b86
msgid "``port``: Default is ``65432``"
msgstr "“端口”：默认为“65432”"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:54 3b98135aa3ab4c0984ee844a7a263a11
msgid "``max_clients``: Default is ``10``"
msgstr "“max_clients”：默认为“10”"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:55 0d69de2576a94317b91bfb78b84e9c37
msgid "``port_add_step``: Default is ``1``"
msgstr "“port_add_step”：默认为“1”"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:56 e29bb04c24e34a1ea6c02e6faee99584
msgid "``port_range_num``: Default is ``100``"
msgstr "“port_range_num”：默认为“100”"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:57 c02189aa1c8e426287fe8d88d648ff94
msgid "``max_file_transfer_thread_num``: Default is ``10``"
msgstr "“max_file_transfer_thread_num”：默认为“10”"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:58 9932eb5d63f944c9b849bf2dee784ded
msgid "``is_hand_alloc_port``: Default is ``False``"
msgstr "“is_hand_alloc_port”：默认为“False”"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:59 81528c16c70543a7ad10852e80a6f13d
msgid "``is_input_command_in_console``: Default is ``True``"
msgstr "“is_input_command_in_console”：默认为“True”"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:60 578be04f88374e2a973044e2dc61f7cb
msgid "``max_custom_workers``: Default is ``10``"
msgstr "“max_custom_workers”：默认为“10”"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:61 acaba660fce8404c84684d0e36d8cb7d
msgid ""
"``is_extend_command``: Default is ``False`` (when ``True``, ``__init__`` "
"will not call ``start_TCP_Server()`` automatically)"
msgstr ""
"“is_extend_command”：默认为“False”（当“True”时，“__init__”不会自动调用“start_TCP_Server()”）"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:63 37766a9885c7432fa81b7895fcd48160
msgid ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``: Default is ``True`` (when ``True``, client "
"connections go through an RSA public-key exchange and all subsequent "
"messages are encrypted)"
msgstr ""
"“is_enable_encrypto”：默认为“True”（当“True”时，客户端连接将通过 RSA 公钥交换，并且所有后续消息都会被加密）"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:66 83be656d3adb41b4984e3e122712ffe3
msgid ""
"``is_custom_keys``: Default is ``None`` (a ``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` "
"list uses a user-supplied keypair instead of the default ``~/.ssh`` / "
"generated keys)"
msgstr ""
"``is_custom_keys``：默认为``None``（``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` "
"列表使用用户提供的密钥对而不是默认的``~/.ssh``/生成的密钥）"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:70 5ad538fcf7a047cb83c06430fc17868b
msgid ""
"The TCP Server Setup API will initialize all the necessary parameters and "
"resources for the TCP server."
msgstr "TCP 服务器设置 API 将初始化 TCP 服务器的所有必要参数和资源。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:73 12ea6aec06374e609665bec9743d0c2d
msgid ""
"*Note: By default ``TCP_Server_Base.__init__`` calls ``start_TCP_Server()`` "
"to start the server automatically. If you set ``is_extend_command=True``, "
"the instance will not auto-start and you should call ``start_TCP_Server()`` "
"manually when ready.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：默认情况下``TCP_Server_Base.__init__`` 调用``start_TCP_Server()`` "
"自动启动服务器。如果您设置“is_extend_command=True”，实例将不会自动启动，您应该在准备好时手动调用“start_TCP_Server()”。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:84 4cb1d5f3304546ce882398fb5c0036ec
msgid ""
"In the `start_TCP_Server` method, we first create a TCP server socket and "
"bind it to the ``self.host`` and ``self.port`` which are initialized in the "
"``__init__`` method."
msgstr ""
"在`start_TCP_Server`方法中，我们首先创建一个TCP服务器套接字并将其绑定到在`__init__`方法中初始化的`self.host`和`self.port`。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:88 6368d16aba2f4d86abe7e07314a8c506
msgid ""
"*Note: The server socket which is set up in the `start_TCP_Server` method is"
" based on IPv4 form.*"
msgstr "*注意：`start_TCP_Server`方法中设置的服务器套接字是基于IPv4形式的。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:91 9ae5345fad7a4ae89537ed31b57bd7c1
msgid ""
"Secondly, according to the ``self.is_input_command_in_console`` parameter, "
"we will start a thread to listen to the console input of the server or not."
msgstr ""
"其次，根据``self.is_input_command_in_console``参数，我们会启动一个线程来监听或不监听服务器的控制台输入。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:95 94e4ccbf323d4134b5297f8c0334ff36
msgid "After that, a main loop to accept clients will be started."
msgstr "之后，将启动接受客户端的主循环。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:97 9416322bf1b64db09658b78f87467976
msgid ""
"*Note: there is another global variable ``self.running`` which is set to "
"``True`` after the server socket is successfully created. The "
"``self.running`` variable is used to control the main loop of the TCP "
"server, and it will be set to ``False`` when the server is shutting down.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：还有另一个全局变量“self.running”，在服务器套接字成功创建后，该变量将变为“True”。 ``self.running`` "
"变量用于控制 TCP 服务器的主循环，当服务器关闭时它将变为 ``False``。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:103 ae36a0bbc490438694c73f02a82e9b31
msgid ""
"The main loop of the TCP server setup function first checks whether the "
"number of connected clients exceeds the maximum number of clients. The "
"maximum number of clients is defined by the ``self.max_clients`` argument of"
" the `TCP_Server_Base` class, which is initialized in ``__init__``."
msgstr ""
"TCP服务器设置函数的主循环首先检查连接的客户端数量是否超过最大客户端数量。最大客户端数量由“TCP_Server_Base”类的“self.max_clients”参数定义，该参数在“__init__”中初始化。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:108 610f3d8802a54760b65ada6338002dd5
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the number of the clients is already over the limit of the connect "
"number, the server will send an overload message and close the connection. "
"But if it does not exceed the limit, the server will set up a client handler"
" function `handle_client` and the server handler function is defined as:"
msgstr ""
"如果客户端数量已经超过连接数量限制，服务器将发送过载消息并关闭连接。但如果没有超过限制，服务器将设置一个客户端处理函数“handle_client”，服务器处理函数定义为："

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:120 cb6a4d4fc9ba4dda90a5763a7364dbc9
msgid ""
"*Note: For more details of the `handle_client` function, see the :ref:`tcp-"
"server-handling-information-api` section.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：有关“handle_client”函数的更多详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`tcp-server-handling-information-"
"api` 部分。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:123 4d09d17dc1d84ddf903333007e3b65fc
msgid "So what can the setup function do if it fails?"
msgstr "那么如果setup函数运行失败了怎么办呢？"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:125 9abaea6541664937a99ee14811cdf79c
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"First, the try-except block in the main server loop checks whether the error"
" is an ``OSError``. If it is, the main loop will exit directly."
msgstr "首先，主服务器循环中的 try 和 except 代码块将检测错误是否为“OSError”。如果是，主循环将直接退出。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:129 527c9ea4b40c48d786e37ae38639b643
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Secondly, if the error is from the network socket, it first logs the error "
"message and also stops the server by calling the function `stop`. And the "
"stop function has been defined as:"
msgstr "其次，如果错误来自网络套接字，它会首先输出错误消息，并通过调用函数“stop”来停止服务器。停止函数定义为："

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:138 3c1ddc7066fe478fb72fe0440ac29069
msgid ""
"To stop the TCP server, it first sets the ``self.running`` variable to "
"False, to stop the main loop of the server. After that, it calls the "
"`free_port` function to free the port which has been allocated. And the "
"`free_port` has been defined as:"
msgstr ""
"要停止 TCP 服务器，它首先将“self.running”变量设置为 "
"False，以停止服务器的主循环。之后，它调用“free_port”函数来释放已分配的端口。 `free_port` 被定义为："

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:149 0be2c10e6bd94c669310ff02fb804b29
msgid ""
"*Note: For more details of the `free_port` function, see the :ref:`tcp-"
"server-port-allocation-api` section.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：有关 `free_port` 函数的更多详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`tcp-server-port-allocation-api` 部分。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:152 2d161cae990b4bd8a0e7f76f6ae54e93
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"At the end of the operations, the TCP server closes all client sockets "
"stored in the ``self.clients`` dictionary and also closes the server socket."
msgstr "在操作结束时，TCP服务器将关闭字典变量“self.clients”中记录的所有客户端套接字，并关闭服务器套接字。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:155 8d9d72393f2c4d04b54a82b0e9ecb465
msgid ""
"*Note: The ``self.clients`` variable is a dictionary that maps client "
"address tuples to an info dictionary. The key is the client address tuple "
"(``(ip, port)``) and the value is a dictionary containing connection details"
" such as ``'socket'``, ``'address'``, ``'id'``, and ``'connected_time'``. "
"See the example below which shows how entries are stored.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：“self.clients”变量是一个字典，它将客户端地址元组映射到信息字典。键是客户端地址元组（``(ip, "
"port)``），值是包含连接详细信息的字典，例如``'socket'``、``'address'``、``'id'`` "
"和``'connected_time'``。请参阅下面的示例，其中显示了条目的存储方式。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:177 31136cb6ca1441a8ad56bf613f047ec0
msgid "TCP Server handling information API"
msgstr "TCP服务器处理信息API"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:179 e0eb184f7fc74d638df934dd3b70a69d
msgid ""
"The server handling information API documents the core TCP server methods "
"that manage client sockets, receive raw data, and send messages."
msgstr "服务器处理信息 API 记录了管理客户端套接字、接收原始数据和发送消息的核心 TCP 服务器方法。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:191 caa9213378e14a5986804e4c09f272ec
msgid ""
"`handle_client` is the main per-client handler in ``TCP_Server_Base``. It is"
" invoked after a client connection is accepted and is responsible for:"
msgstr "`handle_client` 是 `TCP_Server_Base` 中主要的每个客户端处理程序。它在客户端连接被接受后被调用，并负责："

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:195 958c3272e38546309404822be5e43430
msgid ""
"adding the client entry into ``self.clients`` with socket, address, id, and "
"connected time"
msgstr "将客户端条目添加到“self.clients”中，其中包含套接字、地址、id 和连接时间"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:196 b61e8c15a51a4fcd8aeedb87fb1206c1
msgid "printing connection information and current client count"
msgstr "打印连接信息和当前客户端计数"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:197 499853560e7c49fab4d3f4970e0836f8
msgid "sending a welcome message to the client"
msgstr "向客户发送欢迎信息"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:198 480ca8697764498fb3b60bbad9672968
msgid ""
"broadcasting ``/client_alloc_port_range`` information to all clients "
"depending on port allocation mode"
msgstr "根据端口分配模式向所有客户端广播“/client_alloc_port_range”信息"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:200 d4f6ec581f71479f9accfc8e6ddfb44f
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"*Note: You can specify the port allocation mode in the arguments which have "
"been defined in the ``TCP_Server_Base`` class. The args which you can change"
" are ``port_add_step``, ``port_range_num`` and ``is_hand_alloc_port``.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：您可以在“TCP_Server_Base”类中定义的参数中指定端口分配模式。您可以更改的参数是“port_add_step”、“port_range_num”和“is_hand_alloc_port”。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:206 3332e60134c144818cbad9ee9670f3c9
msgid "receiving raw bytes from the socket using `receive_message`"
msgstr "使用“receive_message”从套接字接收原始字节"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:207 ffc19de5f2e6448f8dfa86382b72ea59
msgid "buffering incoming data until newline-terminated messages are complete"
msgstr "缓冲传入数据，直到换行符终止的消息完成"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:208 5599c38881f743b2b285a43b57f80dba
msgid "splitting and processing each message line-by-line"
msgstr "逐行拆分和处理每条消息"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:209 4379426aed934a63ab888013c00c22e9
msgid "routing special commands beginning with ``/`` to `handle_command`"
msgstr "将以 ``/`` 开头的特殊命令路由到 `handle_command`"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:211 d2d782beecec4cd08c03aaa7200c92e9
msgid "The `handle_command` function is defined as:"
msgstr "“handle_command”函数定义为："

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:222 0e5be543d51b47c4b3d278ee1895e6e3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In `handle_command`, there are variable conditional branches to handle "
"built-in commands like ``/help``, ``/time``, ``/clients``, ``/quit``, and "
"some file transfer commands. If you already added more commands by the "
"command extension API, the function will determine if the input message "
"matches the extension commands."
msgstr ""
"在“handle_command”中，有可变条件分支来处理内置命令，如“/help”、“/time”、“/clients”、“/quit”以及一些文件传输命令。如果您已经通过命令扩展"
" API 添加了更多命令，该函数将确定输入的消息是否与扩展命令匹配。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:230 5ec550e3acd6437faf76d3e4aa8d416c
msgid ""
"*Note: For more details of the command extension API and the built-in "
"commands, see the :ref:`tcp-server-command-api` section.*"
msgstr "*注意：有关命令扩展 API 和内置命令的更多详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`tcp-server-command-api` 部分。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:233 4973d45b4a6843c5a4f293cfd00d9075
msgid "logging normal chat messages and acknowledging receipt"
msgstr "记录正常聊天消息并确认收到"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:234 fd86dd8af215423baa10cd23496f4dd8
msgid ""
"removing the client from ``self.clients`` and closing the socket when the "
"client disconnects or an error occurs"
msgstr "从“self.clients”中删除客户端，并在客户端断开连接或发生错误时关闭套接字"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:244 d86a2ca1f2f54a2683d2bee076a5ee17
msgid ""
"`receive_message` is a thin wrapper around socket receive operations. It "
"reads up to ``msg_length`` bytes from the given ``client_socket`` and "
"returns the raw byte payload. Message decoding and newline message framing "
"are handled by the caller."
msgstr ""
"`receive_message` "
"是套接字接收操作的一个薄包装器。它从给定的“client_socket”读取最多“msg_length”字节并返回原始字节有效负载。消息解码和换行消息帧由调用者处理。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:259 ee8e9bc8f0c24169a41913335c71e20f
msgid ""
"`send_message` sends data back to a specific connected client. It verifies "
"the server is running and the socket is valid, then:"
msgstr "`send_message` 将数据发送回特​​定的连接客户端。它验证服务器正在运行并且套接字有效，然后："

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:262 6bc8f2ed0c5b47ebae081500b4a8ee17
msgid "accepts both ``str`` and ``bytes`` message payloads"
msgstr "接受“str”和“bytes”消息负载"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:263 e8f911020564467da472399e31903bfc
msgid "trims string payloads and appends a newline if missing"
msgstr "修剪字符串有效负载并在丢失时附加换行符"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:264 9930b22f9876439b9525ba8496e78746
msgid ""
"when the socket is in encrypted mode (the public-key exchange has "
"completed), the plaintext is signed with the ``_VALID`` marker, RSA-OAEP "
"encrypted with the peer's public key, base64 encoded and newline-terminated "
"instead of being sent in cleartext"
msgstr ""
"当套接字处于加密模式时（公钥交换已完成），明文使用“_VALID”标记进行签名，RSA-"
"OAEP使用对等方的公钥加密，base64编码并以换行符结尾，而不是以明文形式发送"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:268 5264ca94bf774560b1546814589ce14e
msgid "encodes string payloads as UTF-8"
msgstr "将字符串有效负载编码为 UTF-8"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:269 11fec3c3b8284477a1a186a65206010b
msgid "sends the complete message with ``client_socket.sendall(data)``"
msgstr "使用“client_socket.sendall(data)”发送完整消息"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:270 6850283513d84335a3dd665a2a3b1aec
msgid ""
"returns ``True`` on success, otherwise logs the error and returns ``False``"
msgstr "成功时返回“True”，否则记录错误并返回“False”"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:272 a6d009915c714d0b91b27de9ab341828
msgid ""
"And there are also some other functions which are used to send message in "
"bulk to the clients, such as the `broadcast` function and the "
"`send_msg_to_specific_client` function."
msgstr "还有一些其他函数用于向客户端批量发送消息，例如“broadcast”函数和“send_msg_to_specific_client”函数。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:280 9a6656e057994b5b8b47f3646d5c5a1d
msgid "TCP Server encrypted channel API"
msgstr "TCP服务器加密通道API"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:282 5b2fd771b1b048c79fc864b674deff8e
msgid ""
"When the server is created with ``is_enable_encrypto=True`` (the default), "
"every connected client goes through an RSA public-key exchange before any "
"message content is encrypted."
msgstr ""
"当使用“is_enable_encrypto=True”（默认值）创建服务器时，每个连接的客户端在加密任何消息内容之前都会经过 RSA 公钥交换。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:287 f4f2a0bec698426f8a27ef5ea92a8381
msgid "Key material"
msgstr "关键材料"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:289 cead6bf72da14e17882bfa717efaab25
msgid ""
"If a PEM private key exists at ``~/.ssh/id_rsa`` it is reused; otherwise a "
"fresh RSA-2048 keypair is generated into ``network_api/.Flow/pvt_key`` "
"(``server_priv.pem`` / ``server_pub.pem``). The exchanged public key is "
"always derived from the private key, so a rotated ``~/.ssh`` pair is picked "
"up automatically."
msgstr ""
"如果 PEM "
"私钥存在于“~/.ssh/id_rsa”中，则它会被重用；否则，将在“network_api/.Flow/pvt_key”（“server_priv.pem”/“server_pub.pem”）中生成新的"
" RSA-2048 密钥对。交换的公钥始终源自私钥，因此会自动选取旋转的“~/.ssh”对。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:294 209ef840b453413e9275b0f15e66b19a
msgid ""
"A user-supplied keypair can be forced with ``is_custom_keys = [pub_key_path,"
" pvt_key_path]``: both files must exist, parse as PEM and pair with each "
"other (a probe encrypted with the public key must decrypt with the private "
"key); an invalid pair is ignored and the default lookup is used."
msgstr ""
"可以使用“is_custom_keys = [pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]”强制用户提供的密钥对：两个文件必须存在，解析为 "
"PEM 并相互配对（使用公钥加密的探针必须使用私钥解密）；无效的对将被忽略并使用默认查找。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:299 7b07e40707f44731bce0333447da195a
msgid ""
"Public keys received from clients are cached in "
"``network_api/.Flow/pub_key`` as ``client_<ip>_<port>.pem`` (the peer "
"endpoint the key came from; ``:`` is replaced with ``_`` so IPv6 literals "
"are safe on every platform, including Windows)."
msgstr ""
"从客户端接收到的公钥以“client_<ip>_<port>.pem”形式缓存在“network_api/.Flow/pub_key”中（密钥来自的对等端点；“:”被替换为“_”，因此"
" IPv6 文字在每个平台上都是安全的，包括 Windows）。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:305 586749e81ee74cbf910960da99cc8f05
msgid "Anti-MITM identity check (TOFU)"
msgstr "反 MITM 身份检查 (TOFU)"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:307 9f105a1266974c87a5a8e14bb24495af
msgid ""
"Every connection re-exchanges public keys in plaintext, and each side "
"records the peer in ``network_api/.Flow/pub_key/pub_key.json``: the key is "
"``(ip, port)`` (a Python tuple of the endpoint the peer connected from), the"
" value is ``[<sha256 of the public key>, <public key PEM>]``."
msgstr ""
"每个连接都以明文形式重新交换公钥，并且每一方都会在“network_api/.Flow/pub_key/pub_key.json”中记录对等点：密钥是“(ip,"
" port)”（对等点连接的端点的 Python 元组），值是“[<公钥的 sha256>,<公钥 PEM>]”。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:312 7aeee8bd543e4ba18ddb38bac749da20
msgid ""
"First connection from an endpoint: the key is recorded and trusted (trust on"
" first use)."
msgstr "来自端点的首次连接：密钥被记录并受信任（首次使用时信任）。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:314 b1702791942e4d24b67dad665350623a
msgid ""
"Later connection presenting the *same* key: accepted. If the endpoint "
"changed (dynamic IP / user-changed port) the record is moved to the new "
"``(ip, port)`` instead of being duplicated."
msgstr "稍后的连接显示*相同*密钥：已接受。如果端点更改（动态 IP / 用户更改的端口），记录将移动到新的“（ip，端口）”而不是重复。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:317 f97b8101a5eb43c587cf67cc4e982576
msgid ""
"Later connection presenting a *different* key for an already-recorded "
"endpoint: the connection is rejected (``/crypto_reject`` is sent and the "
"socket closed)."
msgstr "稍后的连接为已记录的端点提供*不同的*密钥：连接被拒绝（发送``/crypto_reject``并关闭套接字）。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:321 ae0671eebddd45d58bab545adba92478
msgid ""
"Because the server-side record is keyed by the client's source port, a "
"client that rotates its keypair is only detected when it reconnects from an "
"unchanged endpoint; with OS-assigned ephemeral ports the new key is recorded"
" as a fresh endpoint. The client-side record is keyed by the fixed server "
"address, so a changed server key is always rejected. To reset trust (rotated"
" keys, new server), delete the ``pub_key.json`` entry (or the whole file)."
msgstr ""
"由于服务器端记录由客户端的源端口作为密钥，因此只有当客户端从未更改的端点重新连接时才会检测到轮换其密钥对的客户端；使用操作系统分配的临时端口，新密钥将记录为新端点。客户端记录由固定服务器地址作为密钥，因此更改的服务器密钥始终会被拒绝。要重置信任（轮换密钥、新服务器），请删除“pub_key.json”条目（或整个文件）。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:330 03781998f89545eca994ec9e5f9602a5
msgid "Handshake"
msgstr "握手"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:332 ccd18cd2834f41bda1071144d95267b4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The client initiates the exchange by sending a plaintext "
"``/crypto_key_exchange <client-nonce>`` greeting; the server replies with "
"``/crypto_key_exchange_ack <server-nonce> <need-client-pub> <force>``. Both "
"sides then push their public key files over the file-transfer mechanism "
"(plaintext) and TOFU-check the received key. Both sides switch to encrypted "
"mode only after ``/crypto_ready`` has been received from the peer (so "
"plaintext and ciphertext never interleave on a connection). On later "
"connections the keys are re-exchanged and TOFU-checked again; the exchange "
"is never skipped, only the identity check short-circuits for known keys. "
"Public-key pushes are only accepted from a connection that actually started "
"the handshake, so an arbitrary unauthenticated peer cannot poison the "
"registry."
msgstr ""
"客户端通过发送明文“/crypto_key_exchange”问候语来启动交换；服务器回复``/crypto_key_exchange_ack "
"<need-client-pub> "
"<force>``。然后，双方通过文件传输机制（明文）推送其公钥文件，并对收到的密钥进行豆腐式检查。只有在从对等方收到“/crypto_ready”后，双方才会切换到加密模式（因此明文和密文永远不会在连接上交错）。在以后的连接中，密钥将被重新交换并再次进行"
" TOFU 检查；交换永远不会被跳过，只有已知密钥的身份检查会短路。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:346 cd0aefb51a01422fa8fa62d8980396a3
msgid "Replay protection"
msgstr "重放保护"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:348 219cff1544774209bfdd23fa94476fec
msgid ""
"The handshake exchanges a random session nonce, and every encrypted line on "
"the wire carries it plus a per-connection sequence number: ``<sender-"
"nonce>|<seq>|<ciphertext>``. The receiver drops a line whose nonce does not "
"match the current session (ciphertext replayed from an older connection) or "
"whose sequence number is not the expected one (ciphertext replayed within "
"the session / out of order); both counters reset when the socket flips to "
"encrypted mode after a (re-)exchange."
msgstr ""
"握手交换随机会话随机数，线路上的每条加密线路都携带它加上每个连接的序列号：``<sender-"
"nonce>|<seq>|<ciphertext>``。接收方丢弃随机数与当前会话不匹配的行（从旧连接重播的密文）或其序列号不是预期的行（会话内重播的密文/乱序）；当套接字在（重新）交换后切换到加密模式时，两个计数器都会重置。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:357 b61e8c15a51a4fcd8aeedb87fb1206c1
msgid "Decode verification and key rotation"
msgstr "解码验证和密钥轮换"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:359 b3bf4ecbb32842889e62e79609bfcd16
msgid ""
"Every encrypted plaintext carries the fixed suffix ``_VALID`` (separated by "
"``_``). If a message cannot be decrypted, or the suffix is missing, the "
"socket drops out of encrypted mode, the local key is reloaded, and a forced "
"``/crypto_key_exchange`` restarts the handshake so both sides re-push their "
"current public keys. The re-exchange itself re-runs the TOFU check: a peer "
"whose key did not change is accepted again, while a peer presenting a "
"*different* key for a recorded endpoint is rejected (see the TOFU section "
"above). A user who intentionally rotates a keypair must delete the stale "
"``pub_key.json`` entry (or the whole file) on the peer side to re-trust the "
"new key."
msgstr ""
"每个加密明文都带有固定后缀“_VALID”（用“_”分隔）。如果消息无法解密，或者后缀丢失，则套接字退出加密模式，重新加载本地密钥，并强制“/crypto_key_exchange”重新启动握手，以便双方重新推送其当前的公钥。重新交换本身会重新运行"
" TOFU 检查：密钥未更改的对等点将再次被接受，而为记录的端点提供“不同”密钥的对等点将被拒绝（请参阅上面的 TOFU "
"部分）。故意轮换密钥对的用户必须删除对等端过时的“pub_key.json”条目（或整个文件）才能重新信任新密钥。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:370 ca79adbaea5e4c4c83540e6082bd6efa
msgid ""
"Re-exchanges are circuit-broken: after ``MAX_DECODE_FAILURES`` (3) "
"consecutive decode failures on one connection the connection is closed "
"instead of re-exchanging, so a garbage-injection or persistent-mismatch "
"storm cannot spin the loop forever. A successful decryption resets the "
"counter."
msgstr ""
"重新交换是断路的：在一个连接上“MAX_DECODE_FAILURES”(3) "
"连续解码失败后，连接将被关闭而不是重新交换，因此垃圾注入或持久不匹配风暴无法永远旋转循环。成功解密会重置计数器。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:384 b85e6f0b61eb4f388cc7c18c08d01c1d
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `broadcast` function sends a message to all clients in the "
"``self.clients`` dictionary and removes clients that are already "
"disconnected from the server. And if the ``exclude_client`` parameter is not"
" ``None``, the server will exclude the client which is specified by the "
"``exclude_client`` parameter when sending the message."
msgstr ""
"在“broadcast”函数中，它将向“self.clients”变量中的所有客户端发送消息，并删除已经与服务器断开连接的客户端。如果“exclude_client”参数不是“None”，则服务器在发送消息时将排除“exclude_client”参数指定的客户端。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:398 9b6a44f792db4afea1a0910d14bdfa54
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `send_msg_to_specific_client` function sends one or more messages to one"
" or more specific clients by their client IDs. The ``message`` argument "
"should contain a command message to send."
msgstr ""
"`send_msg_to_specific_client` 函数用于通过客户端 ID "
"向一个或多个特定客户端发送一条或多条消息。并且“message”参数应该输入发送消息命令。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:402 5c93a8b7df9c4ba592e31a8a7c5d7dad
msgid ""
"These methods form the server's client I/O loop and ensure reliable message "
"exchange for connected TCP clients."
msgstr "这些方法形成服务器的客户端 I/O 循环，并确保连接的 TCP 客户端进行可靠的消息交换。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:409 fc06292f70904c668e628446b1338225
msgid "TCP Server command API"
msgstr "TCP 服务器命令 API"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:411 ba0fa4e7318744b8b676846bf49e4859
msgid ""
"The server supports several built-in commands and a command extension API. "
"The main entry point is the `handle_command` method, which is invoked for "
"any message starting with ``/``."
msgstr "服务器支持多个内置命令和命令扩展 API。主要入口点是“handle_command”方法，任何以“/”开头的消息都会调用该方法。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:416 b5777f13d35f4f26ae617247f91c26b0
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We support two solutions for command handling: inputting a command in the "
"console or receiving a command from other clients. You can also call the "
"functions defined for each command in the code."
msgstr "我们支持两种命令处理方案，一种是在控制台输入命令，另一种是从其他客户端接收命令，您也可以调用代码中为命令定义的函数。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:421 55f3dddd875a4c9c8ae20b9136d46687
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"*Note: You can select the solution which you want to use by changing the "
"args of the `TCP_Server_Base` class, the arg is "
"``is_input_command_in_console``. ``True`` allows the server to input the "
"command in console, while ``False`` does not allow it.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：您可以通过更改“TCP_Server_Base”类的参数来选择要使用的解决方案，该参数为“is_input_command_in_console”。"
" ``True`` 允许服务器在控制台输入命令，而``False`` 不允许。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:428 ad8952a11a4947988db649c68b52a743
msgid "Built-in client commands include:"
msgstr "内置客户端命令包括："

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:430 39ff77f126e1412d8406d435655743e1
msgid "``/help``: returns the available command list and usage hints."
msgstr "``/help``：返回可用的命令列表和使用提示。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:431 78375e446e9d48f1958b500306d3c73c
msgid "``/time``: returns the current server time."
msgstr "``/time``：返回当前服务器时间。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:432 622d1d6fabab4e3c9871b3d9f231c352
msgid "``/clients``: returns the list of connected client IDs."
msgstr "``/clients``：返回已连接的客户端 ID 列表。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:433 10f588280ba8440681dc59a414e3af8a
msgid "``/quit``: returns a goodbye message and disconnects the client."
msgstr "``/quit``：返回一条再见消息并断开客户端连接。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:434 9be97d4482b24ae98c3d863f51128eea
msgid ""
"``/file <file_path> <client_id>``: starts a file transfer request from "
"client to server."
msgstr "``/file <file_path> <client_id>``：启动从客户端到服务器的文件传输请求。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:435 bebd16ce5960408ebfd51b440943241c
msgid ""
"``/file_folder <folder_path> <client_id>``: starts a folder transfer request"
" from client to server."
msgstr "``/file_folder <folder_path> <client_id>``：启动从客户端到服务器的文件夹传输请求。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:436 56efc16c32234ab28bae72fc31310836
msgid ""
"``/server_file_transfer_port <port> <client_id>``: internal protocol message"
" used to coordinate file transfer ports."
msgstr "``/server_file_transfer_port <port> <client_id>``：用于协调文件传输端口的内部协议消息。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:438 2f2a9a9f4bb74954b2da2e5e4d9f9169
msgid ""
"In `handle_command`, the server will first check if the command matches any "
"built-in commands. If it does, the `handle_command` will call the functions "
"which are defined for the commands."
msgstr ""
"在`handle_command`中，服务器将首先检查该命令是否与任何内置命令匹配。如果这样做，“handle_command”将调用为命令定义的函数。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:443 d5c00491ac2343c597c6bad8a8398ecc
msgid ""
"If a command is not recognized by the built-in handler, `handle_command` "
"will check if it matches any registered custom commands from the command "
"extension API. If the command is already registered, the `handle_command` "
"will call the function defined for that command. The command extension API "
"is defined as:"
msgstr ""
"如果内置处理程序无法识别命令，“handle_command”将检查它是否与命令扩展 API "
"中注册的任何自定义命令匹配。如果该命令已注册，则“handle_command”将调用为该命令定义的函数。命令扩展 API 定义为："

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:461 996f9af0f74e4e3a91427fe3c5ab134e
msgid "The args of the `register_command` function are as follows:"
msgstr "`register_command` 函数的参数如下："

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:464 1cecc25c6761455dbace5be3acfd7a86
msgid "``command_name``: The name of the command to register."
msgstr "``command_name``：要注册的命令的名称。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:466 dcc654ebd8e442a8bdc84d7a10b6529c
msgid ""
"*Note: The ``command_name`` should start with a slash (e.g., "
"``/my_command``) to be recognized as a command.*"
msgstr "*注意：``command_name`` 应以斜杠开头（例如，``/my_command``）才能被识别为命令。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:469 318f344187d94270a1a4d72570885b0e
msgid "``handler``: The function to call when the command is received."
msgstr "``handler``：收到命令时调用的函数。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:471 b1975fd3ac9b4b1d881ec7e426bde717
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"*Note: The ``handler`` function must have exactly three parameters: "
"``client_socket``, ``client_address``, and ``command``. ``client_socket`` "
"will be accepted as the network socket object that sent the command, "
"``client_address`` will be accepted as the address of the client that sent "
"the command, while the ``command`` parameter will contain the actual command"
" string.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：“handler”函数必须且仅具有三个参数，即“client_socket”、“client_address”和“command”。 "
"``client_socket`` 将被接受为发送命令的网络套接字对象，``client_address`` "
"将被接受为发送命令的客户端的地址，而``command`` 参数将包含实际的命令字符串。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:479 41a12356235c4a84a313c89e9014dfd7
msgid "``where_to_run``: Specifies where the command should be executed."
msgstr "``where_to_run``：指定应执行命令的位置。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:480 dbd6f0bf76c24392a9a8c8881a242f37
msgid ""
"``run_in_thread``: A boolean indicating whether to run the command in a "
"separate thread."
msgstr "``run_in_thread``：一个布尔值，指示是否在单独的线程中运行命令。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:482 b01ae3ada1c24cd7893860085676d8ec
msgid ""
"This extension API allows server-side and console-side custom commands to be"
" registered dynamically. Valid values for ``where_to_run`` are "
"``\"server\"`` and ``\"client\"``. The ``\"server\"`` means the command will"
" be handled when a client sends the command, while the ``\"client\"`` means "
"the command will be handled when the server input the command in console."
msgstr ""
"此扩展 API 允许动态注册服务器端和控制台端自定义命令。 “where_to_run” 的有效值为“服务器”和“客户端”。 "
"“服务器”表示当客户端发送命令时将处理该命令，而“客户端”表示当服务器在控制台中输入命令时将处理该命令。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:491 c6e04ec672f840a4b2825d247ea454b1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"*Note: It's true that the valid values for ``where_to_run`` are not ideal, "
"but we have not yet found a better way to define that.*"
msgstr "*注意：确实，``where_to_run`` 的有效值太奇怪了，但我们没有找到更好的方法来定义它。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:495 c16f63a156b94fec815ca854db5582e5
msgid ""
"The ways to run the command will be different according to the args "
"``run_in_thread``. If ``run_in_thread`` is ``True``, the command handler "
"will be executed in a separate thread from the server's thread pool. If "
"``run_in_thread`` is ``False``, the command handler will be executed "
"synchronously in the main server thread."
msgstr ""
"根据参数“run_in_thread”，运行命令的方式会有所不同。如果“run_in_thread”为“True”，则命令处理程序将在服务器线程池中的单独线程中执行。如果“run_in_thread”为“False”，则命令处理程序将在主服务器线程中同步执行。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:503 5bb8206ec18f4e30b041f59d8f01149b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"*Note: We store the registered commands in a list variable with two "
"dictionaries in its inner layer, and the list variable is defined as "
"``self._custom_handlers`` which is initialized in the `__init__` method. The"
" command and its handler will be stored in one of the dictionaries according"
" to the value of ``where_to_run``. For ``\"server\"``, it will be stored in "
"the first dictionary, otherwise in the second dictionary. And the keys of "
"the dictionaries are the command names, and the value is another dictionary "
"containing the handler function. And there is also another list variable "
"defined as ``self._custom_handler_threaded`` which is initialized in the "
"`__init__` method, it contains all the commands that should be run in a "
"separate thread or not.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：我们将注册的命令存储在一个列表变量中，该列表变量的内层有两个字典，该列表变量定义为“self._custom_handlers”，在“__init__”方法中初始化。命令及其处理程序将根据“where_to_run”的值存储在其中一个字典中。对于``“server”``，它将存储在第一个字典中，否则存储在第二个字典中。字典的键都是命令名，值是另一个包含处理函数的字典。还有另一个列表变量定义为“self._custom_handler_threaded”，它在“__init__”方法中初始化，它包含所有应该在单独线程中运行或不运行的命令。*"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:522 7c89b48e35294024ac14fbe88f8185c0
msgid ""
"After that, the command handler will be called according to the command "
"name, and run them by a command executor which is defined as:"
msgstr "之后，命令处理程序将根据命令名称被调用，并由命令执行器运行它们，命令执行器定义为："

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:536 adad339fc05047dd81c3bd67171a6789
msgid ""
"In this executor function, there is a try-except code block to catch the "
"error when running the command handler. If there is an error when running "
"the command handler, the server will log the error message and also send the"
" error message back to the client if the command is from the client side. "
"And in the try code block, the command handler will be called with the "
"command arguments, and also the client socket and client address if the "
"command is from the client side."
msgstr ""
"在此执行器函数中，有一个 try 和 except "
"代码块来捕获运行命令处理程序时的错误。如果运行命令处理程序时出现错误，服务器将记录错误消息，并且如果命令来自客户端，也会将错误消息发送回客户端。在 "
"try 代码块中，将使用命令参数调用命令处理程序，如果命令来自客户端，还会使用客户端套接字和客户端地址。"

#: ../../Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:546 310214b7550f4c098c28e4f100ef1382
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the command doesn't run in the thread, the command executor will be "
"called directly in the `handle_command` function. But if the command should "
"run in a separate thread, the command executor will be submitted to the "
